Internal evaluation and proposed public license

The original source code, generated rational fixtures and proof notes in this archive are supplied for internal evaluation. A public release and a copyright/licensing declaration have not been authorized by the human authors in this interaction. No public-release consent is asserted.

The intended public code license is MIT, subject to confirmation by the appropriate rights holders. The following proposed text is retained for that decision; it is not a representation that an unapproved person has granted publication rights.

